<title>PERU: Peru's Compania Nacional de Cerveza 9-mo net down.</title>
<headline>Peru's Compania Nacional de Cerveza 9-mo net down.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 6.04 million soles vs 19.14 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 156.66 million soles vs 156.06 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Compania Nacional de Cerveza is Peru's second largest brewery.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
